 🌾 Smart Agriculture & Farmer Assistance System

A full-stack Django-based Smart Agriculture Management Platform designed to connect Farmers, Buyers, Government Officers, Delivery Staff, and Admin in one digital ecosystem.

The system helps farmers sell products, purchase seeds/fertilisers, receive farming alerts, chat with officers, track deliveries, and predict crop diseases using Machine Learning.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 👨‍🌾 Farmer Module
- Farmer registration with admin approval
- Manage profile & farming products
- Buy government seeds & fertilisers
- Add to cart & secure payment simulation
- View order tracking & delivery updates
- Submit product/seed feedback
- Chat with government officers
- View farming alerts & updates
- AI-based Crop Disease Prediction

---

 🛒 Buyer Module
- Buyer registration/login
- Browse & filter farmer products
- Add products to cart
- Quantity management
- Payment system simulation
- Track delivery status
- Submit product ratings & reviews

---

 🏛 Government Officer Module
- Manage officer profile
- Add/Edit/Delete seeds & fertilisers
- Publish farming alerts (image/video)
- View farmer feedback
- Chat support for farmers

---

 🚚 Delivery Module
- Delivery boy management
- Admin order assignment
- Update delivery progress
- Mark orders delivered
- Track active & completed deliveries

---

 👨‍💼 Admin Module
- Approve/Reject farmers
- Manage buyers/officers/delivery staff
- Assign product deliveries
- View all products & feedback
- Monitor system activities

---

 🤖 Machine Learning Integration

 Crop Disease Prediction System
Uses trained ML model to predict crop diseases based on:

- Crop Type
- Temperature
- Humidity
- Soil Moisture
- Rainfall

 ML Tools Used
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib
- Label Encoding
- Classification Model

